includes: The music now shapes the physical output, not just the screen. When you play, the sounding chord drives Art-Net / sACN lighting colour the perceptually-honest way (OKLab hue, amplitude-weighted), and ADM-OSC immersive objects move by pitch (azimuth/elevation) and loudness (distance/gain). Your body stays the co-modulator — bio drives light/space when no music sounds. This rides a new universal Signal Router foundation: one typed patchbay over all channels (internal + in/out) covering the relevant industry standards — MIDI/MPE/MIDI 2.0, RTP-MIDI, OSC, ADM-OSC, Art-Net/sACN, Audio/AUv3, Ableton Link, BLE, plus RTMP/SRT/NDI as honest roadmap. Builds on the workstation home (Arrange · Clips · Compose) and the live Music→Colour visual. Lighting/spatial stay opt-in. Verified: Xcode Compile Check + CI green.
